<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; }
    .header { background: #1976d2; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .content { background: #fafafa; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
    .record-number { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; }
    .footer { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px;">Zapisnik o ugradnji – SIM Tracker</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Poštovani,</p>
      <p>U prilogu Vam šaljemo odobreni zapisnik o ugradnji broj <span class="record-number">{{recordNumber}}</span>.</p>
      <p>PDF dokument je priložen ovom email-u.</p>
      <p>Srdačan pozdrav,<br>SIM Tracker</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Ovaj email je automatski generisan. Ne odgovarajte na ovu poruku.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
